      "kind": "planning decision",
      "description": "For a restaurant opening in the ground floor of the Francisco Bay Office Park garage, the City Planning Commission unanimously allowed partly etched windows but refused a wooden entrance pergola as out of keeping with the 1973 planned development (Resolution 7741).",
